            "review_title": "Review at Antico Fornaio District 7",
            "review_text": "Brett T\n1 contribution\n0\nTerrible experience.\nDec 2025 • Couples\nLast night we visited the much anticipated trip to this restaurant.we arrived at 6.50 to be told there were no spaces for us. Outside was full so I looked through the window and the restaurant was empty. So they were about to send paying customers away. I spoke with the manager who sat us down inside. Eventually a waitress brought us a menu with different foccasia’s which looked very nice. We ordered drinks and then our food. The waitress then told us there was no forcassia and the had run out🤣🤣🤣. 6.50 on a Saturday night the restaurant runs out of its premium dish! You couldn't make this stuff up if you tried??. We got up to leave and find a restaurant that sold food when I spoke to the manager again asking her how she felt about this. She said they had run out of forcassia at lunchtime that day!! What accept bookings and walk ins when YOU HAVE NO FOOD! Blizzard start to a soon to be gone restaurant.\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nMake sure they have food before you nook\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten December 7, 2025",
